      "id": "claim_4db3abcc6a414664b874c4492224bd0a",
      "statement": "CI tears its stacks down on every run — the app-ci app-e2e job's 'Tear down CI stacks (always)' step runs under if: always() — so a leftover CI stack cannot hold a host port indefinitely and starve a prod redeploy the way the original incident did.",
