    {
      "id": "claim_dbea6e6e726d44b7b68bdca924998e07",
      "statement": "TS_ADMIN_IP is now fully retired: it was only ever the bind prefix for the two observability operator UIs, feature 028 made those binds 0.0.0.0 so no compose bind had read it since, and infrastructure-as-code/komodo/stacks.toml stopped passing it to prod-observability on 2026-10-13 (item #727) — no stack or compose file reads it any more and the operator checklist records the Komodo Variable itself as removed, so a leftover seed could not have failed a deploy and the only cost of one would have been dead config.",
