    {
      "id": "claim_22b08c49ea2147a0b3fb74f29e5ae3fa",
      "statement": "Because the collision gate discovers candidate compose files with only two globs (infrastructure-as-code/docker/**/compose*.yaml and infrastructure-as-code/docker/stacks/*.compose.yaml), a CI/dev compose whose basename does not begin with `compose` is never scanned: infrastructure-as-code/docker/dev-ollama.compose.yaml publishes 0.0.0.0:11434 and is invisible to the gate.",
