    {
      "id": "claim_131194ce1277421b99695e9a59367864",
      "statement": "A tree-wide grep for the retired bind-prefix variables KC_ADMIN_BIND_IP and TS_ADMIN_IP surfaces the gates that guarded them rather than live config: scripts/check-komodo-sync.mjs keeps 'KC_ADMIN_BIND_IP=[[TS_ADMIN_IP]]' as a clean-sample fixture and a fake Tailscale address under KC_ADMIN_BIND_IP as a planted-literal fixture, and scripts/check-prod-ci-port-collision.mjs keeps '${TS_ADMIN_IP}:3030:3000' as a parser case — all deliberately planted selftest inputs, so a grep hit must be checked for fixture/comment status before it is read as a live bind prefix.",
