      "id": "claim_4b4b6a3c258f40378cb63c88ea4bed87",
      "statement": "A new or moved prod published port is assigned inside the 19000–19099 range and echoes the number it replaces (8099 → 19099, 3030 → 19030, 3002 → 19002), and the collision gate's failure output prescribes exactly that remedy — move the prod port into the prod-reserved range 19000–19099, or pick a non-overlapping port.",
